@startuml device
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #6B5FA0
skinparam TitleFontColor #4A2C8F
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 28
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #3AA9B8
  BackgroundColor #E2F6F8
  RoundCorner 12
}
skinparam card {
  BorderColor #8E6CCF
  BackgroundColor #F8F5FD
}
<style>
card {
  MinimumWidth 210
  HorizontalAlignment center
}
rectangle {
  MinimumWidth 260
}
</style>
title 调用设备的确定方式\n（workload 实例化按同一规则放置张量）

card "声明 device: cpu 的张量固定在 CPU，不参与下面的判定" as pre
card "有调用期张量？\n（张量序列的每个元素都计入）" as c1
card "参数 device 不为 None？" as c2
card "取当前 accelerator 设备；\n没有 accelerator 时为 None" as r5 #E2F6F8;line:3AA9B8

rectangle "取这些张量的设备；它们须位于同一设备" as r1
rectangle "取 device；字符串按 torch.device 解析" as r2

pre -down-> c1
c1 -down-> c2 : 否
c2 -down-> r5 : 否
c1 -right-> r1 : 是
c2 -right-> r2 : 是

r1 -[hidden]down- r2

note bottom of r5 #FBFAFE
  确定调用设备后，out 与输出在该设备上检查或分配
end note
@enduml
